<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>技术博客 - 文章详情</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "微软雅黑", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f0f6fd 0%, #dbe9fa 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        /* 页头 */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b7de0 0%, #00b4d8 100%);
            padding: 42px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header-title {
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
        }
        /* 导航 */
        .nav {
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(43, 125, 224, .12);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 28px;
        }
        .nav marquee { display: none; }
        .nav a {
            color: #2b7de0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            transition: all .25s;
        }
        .nav a:hover { background: #2b7de0; color: #ffffff; }
        /* 主内容区 */
        .main {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 24px;
            padding: 42px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(43, 125, 224, .15);
            padding: 30px 36px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 720px;
        }
        .card b {
            font-size: 19px;
            color: #22303f;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            padding-left: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2b7de0;
        }
        /* 文章目录 */
        .toc {
            background: #f5f9ff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            line-height: 2;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .toc a { color: #2b7de0; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
        .toc a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        /* 正文 */
        .article-body { line-height: 1.9; color: #33404e; }
        .article-body img {
            max-width: 100%;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            border: 1px solid #e2ebf5;
        }
        /* 评论表单 */
        .comment-form div { margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .comment-form input[type="text"],
        .comment-form textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #d3dce6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
        }
        .comment-form textarea { height: 90px; resize: vertical; }
        .comment-form input[type="text"]:focus,
        .comment-form textarea:focus {
            border-color: #2b7de0;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(43, 125, 224, .15);
        }
        .comment-form input[type="submit"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b7de0, #00b4d8);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity .25s, transform .15s;
        }
        .comment-form input[type="submit"]:hover { opacity: .88; transform: translateY(-1px); }
        /* 页脚 */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
            font-size:13px;
            color:#6b7a8d;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-title">技术博客</div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav">
        <marquee>欢迎阅读本站文章，欢迎留言评论！</marquee>
        <a href="#">首页</a> | <a href="#">关于我们</a> | <a href="#">联系我们</a>
    </div>
    <div class="main">
        <div id="article-content">
            <div class="card">
                <b>HTML5 学习笔记</b>
                <div class="toc">
                    目录：<br>
                    <a href="#item1">一、HTML5 简介</a><br>
                    <a href="#item2">二、语义化标签</a>
                </div>
                <div class="article-body">
                    <p>本笔记介绍 HTML5 的核心特性，适合初学者快速入门。</p>
                    <img src="html5-logo.png" alt="HTML5标志">
                    <p id="item1">HTML5 是新一代网页标准，支持多媒体、绘图与语义化等丰富特性。</p>
                    <p id="item2">在编写网页时，应尽量使用语义化标签，让结构更清晰、更利于 SEO。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="comment-content">
            <div class="card">
                <b>发表评论</b>
                <form class="comment-form" action="comment.php" method="post">
                    <div>昵称：<input type="text" name="nickname"></div>
                    <div>评论：<textarea name="comment"></textarea></div>
                    <div><input type="submit" value="提交评论"></div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        版权所有 © 2026 某某公司
    </div>
</body>
</html>
